<title>USA: Alcan cuts U.S. aluminum prices by 4 cents.</title>
<headline>Alcan cuts U.S. aluminum prices by 4 cents.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcan Aluminium Limited said it cut its U.S. aluminum list prices by 4 cents per pound, effective May 1, when ingot will be 80 cents, and billet at 90 cents.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
